Package: planetary-cspice
Version: 0.67.0
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Yann Chemin <dr.yann.chemin@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6
Installed-Size: 4616
Description: NAIF CSPICE toolkit built as a shared library
 The NASA NAIF CSPICE toolkit (N0067) compiled as a position-independent
 shared object (libcspice.so) plus its C headers, installed under
 /usr/local. Used by p-landing-grass (and other planetary GIS tools) for
 real-ephemeris sub-solar and sub-observer computations through a thin
 ctypes wrapper.
 .
 CSPICE itself is produced by NASA/JPL NAIF and distributed under the NAIF
 license; see /usr/local/share/doc/planetary-cspice/copyright. This package
 only repackages the upstream sources as a shared library; it adds no code.
